  "result": "The six-question quiz on O4 is ready, with its key. It's `quizzes/0002.json` (\"Workflows, agents and who owns the control flow\") and `keys/0002.json`.\n\n- **Content:** four multiple-choice and two short-answer items. They use makerspace cases like booking, manual questions and the laser-cutter request, and the last two items ask for a decision and a cost argument.\n- **Ahead of the lessons:** there is no lesson on O4 yet. I wrote the items from the standard distinction (code owns the path in a workflow, the model owns it in an agent) without searching for or citing a source. I can add a lesson on it next.\n- **New misconception ids:** I added `M7` (agents are better, so use them everywhere) and `M8` (a system that calls a model at a step counts as an agent). These ids are used in the key's distractors.\n- **Self-check:** I answered each item from its stem alone and found one defensible answer each. I did not run any script on the files.",
